{"data":{"title":"Obtaining","slug":"obtaining","path":"/artists/soia/tracks/obtaining/","artwork":"images/artists/soia/tracks/obtaining.jpg","artist":{"id":"Gt50fuTh9gQ","slug":"soia","links":null,"title":"Soia","artwork":null},"id":"BECOJFN-Ga4"},"appearanceCount":2,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"TLH866PMvUw","show":{"id":"2VzgalrnHZc","slug":"268","title":"Soulection Radio Show #268 w/ Jerreau","artwork":"/images/episodes/268.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","published_at":"2016-07-16T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":71833,"platform":"lastfm","href":"https://www.last.fm/music/soia/_/OBTAINING","artwork":"https://lastfm-img2.akamaized.net/i/u/300x300/3db58b12c4c84eedce76c6f330eb121c.png","last_checked_at":"2018-05-15T16:01:14+00:00","track":"BECOJFN-Ga4"},{"id":71832,"platform":"deezer","href":"https://www.deezer.com/track/67266056","artwork":"https://e-cdns-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/6d1dd8441944ad19b6c36706484d5c3f/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","last_checked_at":"2020-01-24T18:08:34.356+00:00","track":"BECOJFN-Ga4"},{"id":71837,"platform":"appleMusic","href":"https://musi